    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "\"This CD contains files that provide a digital version of USGS map I-1853-A, Precambrian basement map of the northern mid-continent, USA, compiled by P.K. Sims and published in 1990. The files are provided in three formats.  Arc export (e00) files can be imported directly into a number of applications.  Arcview shape files and a related Arcview project allow direct viewing and manipulation of the map information. The files are also presented in Spatial Data Transfer Standard (SDTS) format.\"",
            "type": "abstract",
